Pedro;

  There are several reasons why some questions are not responded to.
Usually , the root reason is that the answer would take too much time.
Either because the question was too complex or because not enough info
was attached or because the questioner indicates a low level of ability.

Your question about CLOSE_WAIT fits the first and second of the above 
reasons. You probably need to buy a couple of good books (W. Richard 
Stevens or Douglas Comer). Or you need to hire a consultant.

A quick answer is... if the connection is still in CLOSE_WAIT 30
minutes later, then it will probably hang until rebooted. Find the
part of your code where you send a fin & ack & !data .

Charlie


