This is from memory, use the man pages.

Assume your Oracle directory (/ora) is in the ora_dmn#ora fileset.

Shut down the database in /ora.
clonefset ora ora2
# This makes a snapshot of the ora_dmn#ora fileset, takes no time.
Start your database.
mount -t advfs ora_dmn#ora2 /mnt
Backup /mnt
umount /mnt
-- 
