Put a script that will start your daemon in /sbin/rc3.d directory. You
should name your script something like Sxxsomething, where xx is a
number (scripts are executed in alphabetic order). Your script should
accept at least 'start' and 'stop' parameters (for starting and
stopping your daemon). Look in existing scripts to see how it should
look like.

