> I tried "mount -t cdfs /dev/rz3a <directory>" with an ISO9660 CD in
> the CD-ROM (SCSI-ID 3) and the result was:
> I/O Error.
> 
> The CD-ROM worked perfectly during installation of Digital Unix.
