Not true. You just need to help the clients to find the samba
server. You can use either lmhosts.sam file on client machines (usualy
in \windows directory) to map netbios names to IP addresses or you
can use samba as wins server. Note that you will probably have
problems with browsing, but the clients will be able to connect to
samba server.

