The Digital Unix built in serial ports are clist devices , not streams
devices thus ppp (and presumably slirp) is not able to insert a streams
module. The work around is quite easy. Once you have logged in , do an
additional rlogin (or telnet) so that you have a streams based psuedo
terminal to insert a module into.

Charlie

PS The more recent versions of ppp have code to workaround these issues.

